  "problem": "A parodic holiday, International Talk Like a Pirate Day, was celebrated for the first time on September 19th, 1995. Given that January 1st, 1995, was a Sunday, use congruences to determine on which day of the week this holiday was celebrated for the first time.\n\n*Hint: The year 1995 was not a leap year since it is not divisible by $4.$*",
